<button class="wp-link" data-k="msg" onclick="routeTo('msg')"><span class="ic">✉</span><span>消息配置</span><span class="path">/msg</span></button>
<button class="wp-link" data-k="system" onclick="routeTo('system')"><span class="ic">🔐</span><span>权限与日志</span><span class="path">/system</span></button>
<button class="wp-link" data-k="dict" onclick="routeTo('dict')"><span class="ic">📖</span><span>数据字典</span><span class="path">/dict</span></button>
<div class="wp-foot">
<button class="wp-link" data-k="all" onclick="routeTo('all')"><span class="ic">⤢</span><span>全部模块</span><span class="path">/all</span></button>
<div class="wp-note">点击菜单写入 URL：#/admin/模块<br>支持浏览器 ← →、刷新保持、复制链接直达；也可在上方输入路由后回车。</div>
</div>
</aside>
<div class="wp-crumb" id="wp-crumb">
<button class="wp-navbtn" title="上一个路由" onclick="routeBack()">←</button>
<button class="wp-navbtn" title="下一个路由" onclick="routeForward()">→</button>
<button class="wp-navbtn" title="刷新当前路由" onclick="applyHash()">↻</button>
<span>运营后台 / <span id="wp-crumb-group">核心运营</span> / <b id="wp-crumb-name">数据看板</b></span>
<code id="wp-hash">#/admin/dash</code>
<span class="wp-live" id="wp-live">● 路由已同步</span>
<span class="wp-spacer"></span>
<input class="wp-route-input" id="wp-route-input" placeholder="输入路由回车跳转，如 /admin/sitter" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter'){goRoute(this.value);this.value='';}">
<button class="wp-go" onclick="goRoute(document.getElementById('wp-route-input').value)">跳转</button>
</div>
<!--/WP-ROUTE-UI-->
<script src="暖爪-原型同步-v1.5.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
